      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Staunton%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The former Western State Asylum, opened in 1828, later became a medium‑security prison after the state moved patients to I‑81.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
